:: Mansion Party HBSC Gala Arrival
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<if $avery_fate is "ascended">><<location "avery_skyscraper">><<else>><<location "office">><</if>><<effects>>
<<if !$avery_party or $avery_mansion.party_state isnot "started">>
	<<avery_mansion_party_init>>
<</if>>
<<npc "Avery" 1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>>
"Stay near enough to be seen with me, but not so near that people mistake you for a conversation. Tonight you're here to improve your image. Mine as well." Avery pauses near the entrance to the salon while guests drift by in satin, silk, and tailored wool.
<br><br>
At the other, a quiet auction is already underway, every smile sharpened by money.
<br><br>
"Be polite to the matron managing the scholarship fund. Circulate among the donors and look housebroken. And when I ask, carry a message without improvising. Do that well enough, and people will start describing you as promising instead of decorative," <<person1>><<he>> says. 
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Party HBSC Gala Tasks]]>><</link>>
<br>

