	The gala hums around you with the soft confidence of old money. Waiters drift between clustered donors. A small ensemble plays by the windows. Near the far wall, a display of scholarship recipients and charitable partners gives the wealthy something tasteful to look at between bids.
	<br><br>
	Avery stands close. "Try to look like you belong indoors."
<<else>>
